WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:23.680
At the left we can see, at the right we can see the hat snarlers, everything is safe,

00:23.680 --> 00:26.680
perfectly safe. Emo? Emo?

00:46.680 --> 00:47.680
Are you hurt?

00:48.680 --> 00:53.680
I don't think so. You?

00:53.680 --> 01:08.680
I'm okay. Get up. Emo, it's not safe here. Let's go. What's next? You'll see. You'll see.

01:08.680 --> 01:17.680
Emo, this way.

01:34.680 --> 01:35.680
Follow me!

01:38.680 --> 01:40.680
Follow me.

02:09.680 --> 02:11.680
Hurry up.

02:15.680 --> 02:22.680
Listen! Listen! Listen! Listen! Listen! Listen!

02:38.680 --> 02:48.680
You're not paying attention.

02:48.680 --> 02:54.680
I just want to answer the phone.

02:54.680 --> 02:59.680
Emo, look, I mean listen.

02:59.680 --> 03:02.680
You have to learn to listen.

03:02.680 --> 03:04.680
This is not some game.

03:04.680 --> 03:09.680
You, I mean we could easily die out here.

03:09.680 --> 03:14.680
Listen, listen to the sounds of the machine.

03:17.680 --> 03:20.680
Listen to your breathing.

03:34.680 --> 03:44.680
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

04:04.680 --> 04:29.680
Well, don't you ever get tired of this?

04:29.680 --> 04:30.680
Tired?

04:30.680 --> 04:34.680
Emo, the machine is like clockwork.

04:34.680 --> 04:40.680
One move out of place and you're ground to a pulp.

04:40.680 --> 04:41.680
That isn't it.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.680
Like, pulp, Emo.

04:43.680 --> 04:46.680
Is that what you want, pulp?

04:46.680 --> 04:49.680
Emo, your goal in life.

04:49.680 --> 04:51.680
Pulp!

05:19.680 --> 05:43.680
Emo, close your eyes.

05:43.680 --> 05:45.680
Why, now?

05:50.680 --> 05:52.680
Okay.

05:52.680 --> 05:54.680
Good.

05:58.680 --> 06:01.680
What do you see at your left side, Emo?

06:01.680 --> 06:04.680
Well, nothing.

06:04.680 --> 06:05.680
Really?

06:05.680 --> 06:07.680
No, nothing at all.

06:07.680 --> 06:08.680
Really?

06:08.680 --> 06:09.680
And, and at your right.

06:09.680 --> 06:11.680
What do you see at your right side, Emo?

06:11.680 --> 06:14.680
The same, Prug.

06:14.680 --> 06:16.680
Exactly the same.

06:16.680 --> 06:17.680
Nothing.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.680
Great.

06:39.680 --> 06:42.680
Listen, Prug, do you hear that?

06:42.680 --> 06:44.680
Can we go here?

06:44.680 --> 06:45.680
There?

06:45.680 --> 06:46.680
Yeah.

06:46.680 --> 06:49.680
It isn't safe, Emo.

06:49.680 --> 06:52.680
Well, but trust me, it's not.

06:52.680 --> 06:54.680
Well, maybe I could...

06:54.680 --> 06:56.680
No.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.680
But...

06:57.680 --> 06:58.680
No!

06:58.680 --> 06:59.680
Right.

06:59.680 --> 07:00.680
No!

07:00.680 --> 07:04.680
Any further questions, Emo?

07:04.680 --> 07:06.680
No.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.680
Emo.

07:10.680 --> 07:11.680
Yeah?

07:11.680 --> 07:13.680
Emo, why?

07:13.680 --> 07:18.680
Why can't you see the beauty of this place?

07:18.680 --> 07:20.680
The way it works.

07:20.680 --> 07:23.680
How, how perfect it is.

07:23.680 --> 07:25.680
No, Prug.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.680
I don't see.

07:26.680 --> 07:30.680
I don't see because there's nothing there.

07:30.680 --> 07:34.680
And why should I trust my life to something that isn't there?

07:34.680 --> 07:36.680
What can you tell me that, Emo?

07:36.680 --> 07:38.680
Answer me.

07:43.680 --> 07:46.680
Prug, you're a sick man.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.680
Stay away from me.

07:51.680 --> 07:53.680
No, Emo.

07:53.680 --> 07:55.680
It's a trap.

07:55.680 --> 07:57.680
It's a trap, huh?

07:57.680 --> 08:01.680
At the left side, you can see the hanging gardens of Babylon.

08:01.680 --> 08:05.680
How's that for a trap?

08:05.680 --> 08:08.680
No, Emo.

08:08.680 --> 08:11.680
At the right side, you can see...

08:11.680 --> 08:12.680
Guess what?

08:12.680 --> 08:14.680
The Colossus of Rhodus!

08:14.680 --> 08:16.680
No!

08:16.680 --> 08:19.680
The Colossus of Rhodus, and it is here just for you, Prug.

08:19.680 --> 08:21.680
Just for you.

08:41.680 --> 08:43.680
It is there.

08:43.680 --> 08:46.680
I'm telling you, Emo.

08:46.680 --> 08:48.680
It is.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.680
It is.

09:11.680 --> 09:24.680
The Colossus of Rhodus

09:41.680 --> 09:51.680
The Colossus of Rhodus

10:11.680 --> 10:21.680
The Colossus of Rhodus

10:41.680 --> 10:52.680
The Colossus of Rhodus

